## Monthly review (5 minutes)

Next review: **Mon, Nov 2**.

1. Import: add last month's exports to your inbox, run `bin/cashcast import`.
2. Statements: every card closed at or under its target and was paid in full.
3. Bank minimums: no monthly fee was charged; top accounts back up to their keep amounts.
4. Rent charges: count this cap year's charges per card; switch the rent card when a count is used up.
5. Credit scores: check Equifax and TransUnion; any drop → find the cause.
6. Cash sweep: invest cash above the reserve, in the account order of your strategy.
